@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1C2B24
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #557567
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F5FAF7
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #7FA694
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #1C2B24
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #A9C4B6
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FDF6E8
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #D9B56A
skinparam sequenceGroupFontColor #8A5A12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FDF6E8
skinparam noteBorderColor #D9B56A

title Market Desk · one Ask turn, with tool calls and confirmation

actor Shopper
participant "Ask page" as Page
participant "AskController" as Ask
participant "HTTP session" as Session
participant "DeepSeekChatClient" as Client
participant "CityU DeepSeek" as LLM
participant "Local tools" as Tools
database "H2" as DB

Shopper -> Page : Type a question
Page -> Ask : POST /ask/send
Ask -> Session : append question, state = WAITING
Ask --> Page : 303 to /ask?chatId

Page -> Ask : fetch /ask/reply
Ask -> Session : claim turn, state = REPLYING
Ask -> Client : reply(prompt, recent 9 messages, 11 tools)
Client -> LLM : POST /chat/completions

loop At most 3 rounds, 8 calls, 30 seconds
  LLM --> Client : assistant message with tool_calls
  Client -> Tools : execute(name, arguments)
  Tools -> DB : read catalogue, cart, wishlist or alerts
  Tools --> Client : checked JSON result
  Client -> LLM : assistant message + tool results
end

LLM --> Client : final assistant text
Client --> Ask : plain-text answer
Ask -> Tools : collect price cards, proposals and draft
Ask -> Session : append reply + actions, state = READY
Ask --> Page : rendered transcript
Page --> Shopper : answer with checked price rows

opt Important change (cart delete, wishlist, alert rule)
  Shopper -> Page : Confirm or Cancel
  Page -> Ask : POST /ask/action
  Ask -> Tools : apply(operation)
  Tools -> DB : write cart, wishlist or rule
  Ask -> Session : receipt, or a fresh proposal if stale
  Ask --> Page : updated transcript
end

note over Tools, DB
  Tools never write directly from model
  output. They return proposals; the
  controller applies direct additions and
  asks for confirmation on important changes.
end note

note over Client, LLM
  Missing API key or a failed/slow turn
  surfaces a retry state. The page polls
  /ask/reply up to 30 times at 500 ms.
end note

@enduml
